  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Waste Governance: Technical Assistance to the EUD (Expected Result 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;global objective &lt;/strong&gt;of this of this assignment is to enhance the contribution of the EU to structural reforms in the waste sector in Lebanon (municipal waste and special streams) following the evaluation of its portfolio in the sector (2018-2020). Its s&lt;strong&gt;pecific objectives &lt;/strong&gt;are to (1) Articulate EU position on the sector; (2) Support the EU Delegation in Lebanon in conducting policy dialogue with primary and secondary stakeholders; (3) Carry out studies of strategic importance to feed the policy dialogue.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
